        ],
        "review": {
          "status": "candidate"
        }
      },
      "definition": {
        "text": "The suprascapular nerve typically carries C5–C6 fibers and passes through the suprascapular notch beneath the superior transverse scapular ligament before continuing toward the spinoglenoid region.",
